      "message": "fix(post): a stop or go-home asked after a live-tool section posts at the end of that section\n\nfanuc-lathe.cps's section end returned from its C-axis live-tool branch\nbefore afterOp(), so an optional stop (M01), program stop (M00) or go-home\nasked after a cross drill or C-axis milling op was not posted there and\nthe pending ask came out after the NEXT section instead.\n\nEvery section now ends with its own ask: the live branch releases the\nlive spindle (live_tool.spindle_off), then the C axis (c_axis_off),\nrestores G99, then afterOp() writes the stop or the X-then-Z home - the\nturning branch's order with the live section's own release words in the\nspindle-stop place. A refused live section still consumes its ask.\n\nPinned by script_fanuc_lathe's after-live tests (M01, M00, go-home, and\nno stop asked) and the new live_then_stop recorded case with goldens in\nevery per-post script suite. No existing golden changes.\n\nFixes #1188\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
